=== Cube

==== Facial & Body diagonal

Facial diagonal join two vertices at the same face.

Body diagonal join two vertices from opposite faces.

// TODO: Convert TikZ diagram to CeTZ
// Original TikZ: 3D cube with facial diagonal (red) and body diagonal (blue)

$
  "Facial diagonal" &= L sqrt(2) \
  "Body diagonal" &= L sqrt(3)
$

==== Area

$ A = 6L^2 $

==== Volume

$ V = L^3 $

==== Circumscribed sphere

Pass through the $8$ vertices, radius equal to $L(sqrt(3)/2)$.

